<title>UK: DGZ-Bank adds 500 mln marks to eight-year bond.</title>
<headline>DGZ-Bank adds 500 mln marks to eight-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager DGZ-Bank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   DGZ-BANK</p>
<p> AMT   *500 MLN DEM   COUPON     5.25	MATURITY    23.JUN.05</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  **	  PAY DATE    08.AUG.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  =	   REOFFER    **	  SPREAD	+5 BP</p>
<p> NOTES	**TO BE PRICED</p>
<p>		 *FUNGIBLE WITH 1.0 BLN DEM LAUNCHED 17.JUN.97</p>
<p> UNDERLYING GOVT 6.875 PCT MAY 2005 BUND.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom  +44 171 542 7970</p>
</text>
